## Proposed Changes (Architecture Roadmap)

### Phase 1: Sales & CRM (Quote-to-Cash)
Implementing the primary revenue-generation pipeline to complement the existing procurement architecture.
#### [MODIFY] schema.prisma
- Add models: `Customer`, `PricingRule`, `Quotation`, `SalesOrder`, `SalesOrderItem`, `ARInvoice`.
#### [NEW] backend/src/controllers/sales/
- Endpoints for customer onboarding, quote generation, and order fulfillment (tying back to Inventory deduction and AR integration).
#### [NEW] frontend/src/pages/sales/
- Dashboards for CRM tracking, Quotation builders, and visual Sales Order funnels.

### Phase 2: Human Capital Management (HCM)
#### [MODIFY] schema.prisma
- Add models: `Employee` (extending User), `Attendance`, `LeaveRequest`, `PayrollRun`, `Payslip`.
#### [NEW] backend/src/controllers/hr/
- Endpoints for executing payroll calculations, managing leave balances, and logging daily attendance.
#### [NEW] frontend/src/pages/hr/
- Employee Directory, Leave Request calendar, and Payroll Execution wizards.

### Phase 3: Financial Depth & Consolidation
#### [MODIFY] schema.prisma
- Add models: `CostCenter`, `ProfitCenter`, `IntercompanyTransfer`.
#### [MODIFY] backend/src/controllers/finance/glController.js
- Inject Cost Center tracking into all Journal Entries. Generate Cash Flow Statement endpoints.
#### [NEW] frontend/src/pages/finance/CostCenters.tsx
- Matrix reporting views isolating profit margins by internal department branches.

### Phase 4: Workflow Engine & Custom Fields (UDF)
#### [MODIFY] schema.prisma
- Add models: `WorkflowRule`, `CustomFieldSchema`, `CustomFieldValue`.
#### [NEW] backend/src/services/workflowEngine.js
- Dynamic rule evaluator intercepting Prisma hooks to trigger auto-approvals or block transitions.
#### [NEW] frontend/src/pages/settings/WorkflowBuilder.tsx
- Visual mapping tool for enterprise admins to define IF/THEN logic.

### Phase 5: Enterprise Security & SSO
#### [MODIFY] backend/src/middleware/authorize.js
- Introduce Field-Level Security (stripping `salary` or `costPrice` from JSON objects if the user role mapping denies access).
#### [NEW] backend/src/routes/auth/ssoRoutes.js
- Integrate `passport-saml` for Google Workspace/Azure AD Active Directory syncing.

## Verification Plan
Each phase constitutes a discrete deployment block.
### Automated Verification
- Prisma schema validation for 1:N relations across the new domains.
- Jest endpoint testing for isolated payroll computations and workflow triggers.
### Manual Verification
- Staging-environment deployment. User testing of the Quote-to-Cash pipeline (creating a Quote -> converting to Sales Order -> verifying auto-deduction of Dual-Stream inventory).
